--   * **`sum_mu`**: `Σ_{y=1}^{s} y·[y·(P mod s) mod s = 1] = muInv P s` for coprime `P, s`, `s ≥ 2`.
--   * **`prod_mod_seq`**: the running product `c ↦ (c·s_{i−1−k}) mod s_i` ends at `prodN n i mod s_i`.
